## 3. Target Audience & Searcher Profile

This article targets renters who are considering a move to Tampa from another city or relocating within the metro, typically in the 25–40 age range. They are in the **discovery to comparison stage** of the renter journey: they know Tampa is on their list but have not yet narrowed down which neighborhood fits their lifestyle, commute, and budget. Their core problem is decision paralysis: there are too many neighborhoods and too little practical guidance written specifically for renters (most competitors write for buyers). They expect a neighborhood-by-neighborhood format with specific rent ranges, honest tradeoffs, and lifestyle characterizations rather than generic promotional copy.

