1. **brightplace framing on renter search patterns:** Include at least one reference to what renters searching on brightplace most commonly ask about Tampa. Example frame: "Renters searching Tampa neighborhoods on brightplace consistently flag two priorities: commute time to downtown and whether a neighborhood is actually walkable or just described that way."

