3. **Honest tradeoffs in every neighborhood section:** Every H2 neighborhood section must include at least one specific, honest tradeoff. The presence of tradeoffs is a strong E-E-A-T marker because it distinguishes genuine expertise from promotional copy.

### 6b. Expertise Signals

